 "subs": [
  {
   "t": 0.15,
   "until": 3.937,
   "text": "Most local businesses still don't have a proper website."
  },
  {
   "t": 3.687,
   "until": 10.064,
   "text": "Some have none at all, some have one that's slow or broken, and some are simply invisible online."
  },
  {
   "t": 12.014,
   "until": 14.839,
   "text": "Every one of them is a potential client."
  },
  {
   "t": 14.589,
   "until": 16.771,
   "text": "The hard part is finding them."
  },
  {
   "t": 16.521,
   "until": 19.411,
   "text": "So at TechnoTribes, we built Lead Finder."
  },
  {
   "t": 20.161,
   "until": 28.837,
   "text": "In the next few minutes, I'll show you how it finds these businesses automatically, ranks them, and gives your team everything it needs to reach out."
  },
  {
   "t": 31.087,
   "until": 34.381,
   "text": "Lead Finder is a private dashboard for your team."
  },
  {
   "t": 34.131,
   "until": 39.785,
   "text": "Everyone signs in with their Google account, and only approved team members can get in."
  },
  {
   "t": 40.535,
   "until": 42.172,
   "text": "One click, and you're in."
  },
  {
   "t": 44.422,
   "until": 47.148,
   "text": "The first thing you see is the Overview:"
  },
  {
   "t": 46.898,
   "until": 53.461,
   "text": "a live summary of every lead found so far, matching the Google Sheet that the system keeps up to date."
  },
  {
   "t": 54.211,
   "until": 59.475,
   "text": "Right now there are one hundred and sixty six leads, all found in the last seven days."
  },
  {
   "t": 60.225,
   "until": 63.311,
   "text": "Every lead falls into one of three types."
  },
  {
   "t": 63.061,
   "until": 66.424,
   "text": "Ninety six businesses have no website at all."
  },
  {
   "t": 66.174,
   "until": 70.505,
   "text": "Twenty nine have a website that's broken, slow or outdated."
  },
  {
   "t": 70.255,
   "until": 74.725,
   "text": "And forty one have a decent site, but almost no reach online."
  },
  {
   "t": 75.475,
   "until": 79.695,
   "text": "So you know not just who to contact, but what to offer each one:"
  },
